    "body": "Completed overnight reports were missing from the current state summary. This updates the existing state PR with all four completed 8M training arms and eight dialogue evaluations, a source-bound report receipt, grounded-session/persistence limitations, the merged source-consumption diagnosis and the next geometric consumer task. STATUS points to current evidence; the roadmap now reflects full-budget L2 confirmation.\n\nThe geometric arms beat the single matched transformer seed on these text-loss panels; L2 wins all three. This is development/reference evidence, not complete native chat or energy qualification. Paired chat judge significance is explicitly against each model’s derangement control, rather than between models. Source consumption still fails on four cases after verified payload delivery.\n\nValidation: check_claim_wording.py and git diff --check pass. Independent review verified all 12 report hashes, copied fields, counts and capability boundaries; its chat-comparison correction is included. No model compute, source-model change or paid run. References #820, #1552, #1512.\n",
